  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、前にライブで昔の写真使うからって\r\nたくさんアルバム持ってきてくれただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022009010030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200901/2022009010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022009010040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そういえば、まだ事務所に\r\n置かせてもらいっぱなしでしたね",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200901/2022009010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022009010050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "す、すみません……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200901/2022009010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、いいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結局全部見きれなかったから\r\nまた後でって話だったけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なかなか時間も取れそうにないし\r\n一旦持ち帰ってもらった方がいいかと思って",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大事なものだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022009010060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……！\r\nは、はい……そうですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200901/2022009010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……でも今日\r\n小糸、荷物がいっぱいだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "車に積んで送って行けたらいいんだけど、\r\n今日はこの後ちょっと打ち合わせでな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022009010070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だ、大丈夫ですよ\r\nまた改めて取りに来ますから",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200901/2022009010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022009010080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、それまでまた少し\r\n置かせてもらうことになっちゃいますけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
